<table height="400" width="550" cellpadding="5" border="0" cellspacing="5" >
<tr height="400" valign="top" >
<td style=" color:#000000; font-size:12pt; background-color:#FFFFFF; font-family:arial; bLabel:main; bEditID:r3st1;" tEditID="c1r1" locked="0" aEditID="c1r1" >
<![CDATA[<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Hello {!Contact.FirstName},&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Admission Services recently received an application fee waiver for you from your school. However, you have applied to Arizona State University as a nondegree-seeking student (meaning you want to take a couple of classes, but are not planning on completing a degree). Waivers are <b>not</b> accepted for nondegree-seeking students, so if this status is correct, please <b>submit your application fee</b> through <a href="http://my.asu.edu/"><b>My ASU</b></a>.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><b>If you do plan to attend ASU to receive a bachelor's degree:&nbsp;</b></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><ol><li><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><a href="http://asu.edu/apply">Submit a new application</a> as soon as possible.&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Select that you are a degree-seeking student and list a major to study.</span></li><li><span style="font-size: 12pt;">When you are asked to pay your application fee, select the <b>Pay Later</b> option.</span></li><li><span style="font-size: 12pt;">We will match your waiver with your application.</span></li></ol></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">If you applied as nondegree-seeking because you have not decided on a major, please use our <a href="http://asu.edu/degrees">degree search</a> tool to find a major based on your favorite subject, career interests or keywords. If you are still undecided, you are welcome to list one of our exploratory programs as your degree interest on your application.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><b>IMPORTANT:</b> Once you have submitted your new application, <a href="http://students.asu.edu/canceladmissions">cancel your nondegree-seeking application</a>.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Let me know if you have any additional questions about the admission process.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Sincerely,</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Title__c}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Admission Services</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Email__c}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Phone__c}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">If you have any additional information or questions related to this, please reply to this email.</font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666"><br></font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>